<title>CANADA: BCE Inc Q4 profit rises with gain.</title>
<headline>BCE Inc Q4 profit rises with gain.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.29		   C$0.86</p>
<p> Net			429,000		  289,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,500,000		7,400,000</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$3.40		   C$2.23</p>
<p> Net		    1,150,000		  782,000</p>
<p> Revs		  28,200,000	     24,600,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Results for the latest quarter include a one-time gain, net of provisions, of C$38 million (C$0.12 per common share). Results for the latest 12 months include one-time gains, net of provisions, of C$125 million (C$0.39 per common share), compared with a gain of C$55 million (C$0.18 per common share) for the prior year.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
